AltoRewardsOracle::updateUniswapNode()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── when _uniswapNode is valid
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when _uniswapNode.pool is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleUniswapInvalidInput
│   ├── when _uniswapNode.twapPeriod is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleUniswapInvalidInput
│   ├── when inToken is not Alto token
│   │   ├── when direction is IN_TO_OUT
│   │   │   └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleInvalidInput
│   │   └── when direction is OUT_TO_IN
│   │       └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleInvalidInput
│   └── when _uniswapNode is valid
│       ├── it should emit SetUniswapNode event with old and new uniswap node
│       ├── it should update uniswapNode to new uniswap node
│       └── it should update inTokenOneUnit based on in-currency decimals
